  "key_findings": "K921 Time-Varying Copula: Patton (2006) dynamic Student-t copula on SPY-GLD (2005-2026). Parameters: omega=0.0073, beta=1.8392, alpha=0.2422, nu(fixed)=3.05. Dynamic rho_t: mean=0.0782 (vs static 0.0940), std=0.2322, range [-0.5933, 0.5939]. Dynamic lambda_t: mean=0.1471, std=0.0685. Crisis early warning: 1/3 crises showed declining pre-crisis lambda. Granger causality: lambda->VIX significant (F=2.62, p=0.0334); VIX->lambda significant (F=9.38, p=0.0022). Lambda(t) vs VIX(t+22): Pearson r=0.0127, Spearman=0.1567. Model comparison: TV preferred by AIC (delta=-143.6), preferred by BIC (delta=-137.1). VaR improvement: see backtest results.",
